<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Qorontoosike Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ergemallo Phawuloosixxa Langaxxaa Erga Qorontoosike Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Qorontoosike Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Qor.</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ergemallo Phawuloosixxa langaxxaa Erga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Qorontoosike Manni'a</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Phaawuloos Qorntoosike manni'a borreisexxi langaxxi era borresendeek Qoeonsttosi giddo hexxemaxxe beetekirstaane welt afe'emaxxa mittima luossha rakkisseexxe kadema woddann, mitte mitte beetekirtsaneti manni haurto aalcho iso'n geeseexxe kadoolenna Phaawuloosi aaraaa assatee lumoxxa halcha afeexxa leelishaan. Tinninna kadda wodda lumoxxi gamsho iso'n laqema dandeetaaxxa lelishaan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isixxe ergaxxe sirtexxe kuta giddo Phawuloos Qorontoosi giddi hexxemaxxe beetekirstaane welt afe'emaxxe mittumaxxe ifisati tenne beetekirstaane giddo cimemanna gareera mayyee dhuudhendeemeeka hissicho insa'ena'a hisseexxa barrsaan. Tenneninni abidiseexxi kunni isik xixichi aada aagatiba'anna aararemati'a insa'ne idageeke kademaxxe iso'n laqendeexxa gammasho insa'ne'n ifisaan. Iitti aanseexxi Yihudi giddo hexxeexxa Kirstoosto gargaratee amatirjoomat uunaashsha insa'ne kulaan; udumaake hafura adhdhanira Phaawuloos isixxe ergamalluma'n shiqeexxe kulaxxe faachocho uwwaan. Qorontoosixxe beetkirtaane giddo mitti mitti manni ifi dhugaatixxe ergameeye assati Phaauwloosi dharcha ergamallon hina'n iso'o ku'lna'eman.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Umo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosinna Qorontoosixxa beetekirstaane <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:12-7:16">1:12—7:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihuda giddo hexxe kirstoosti'a gargaarsa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1—9:15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloos ifixxe ergamallumaxxe shiqisheexxa faachchfachcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10:1—13:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxama <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 13:11-14">13:11-14</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Mageniinxe fedhinn Yessuusi Kiristoosike ergamallo kade'eeke Pawuloosinaa'ninna dayyo no'oke Ximotoosinaa'n.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Qorontoosi afeenda'nexxe Magenke tuuti'ana iitanni Akkaayiyaa afendaaxxe ammanye Woyyoole duuchchi'a.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Magen anni no'okikinna Gootti Yessuusi Kiristoosi badhaadhinna nage'i ha'noni welti hedhowwaal.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Magenoke'e Shiqisheeka Galata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Marartetik anninna dayyesak duuchchike Mageno kade'eek no'oka Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosike anni'a Mageni'a galati geyowaal. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />No'o Magenbaa'ni alfinenexxe dayyeesanni rakkoti giddo hedhdheka manna duuchcha dayeesa dandenanoshsha Magen no'o rakko no'oxxe duuchcha'n dayyeesa'neen. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kirsitoosixxi abara no'on birasaxxeexxe qixxe'n iittani Kiristoosi darree'n no'a dayya'a bira saxxaan. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />No'o abara uunda'enelchi ha'no daya'atanna anjira alfitino'aten. No'o dayaanano wodda dayaananelchi ha'no no'o uundenexxa abara osati adhdhitineexxi dayatino'aten. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Abara no'oxxa qoodendinemaashaani daya'a no'oxxanna qoodendinaaxxa egennenaxxe'e no'o ha'no'n anfeenexxi adde jabaxxen.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Anke dayyuwwa! No'o Issiyake boga'n he'nenna wodda no'o'ni gelteexxi rakko egendino'a eenaaneni; tinni no'o'n gelteexxi rakkon dandeenabe'noxxe kadeemaxxe'e lubboti hedhdhotinxi adde midde hexxemabaani. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Tenne waali, rewotixxi murrite no'o'ni murrendeecho labe'e no'o'ni laqendeemaani. Tinni duuchcha no'o'ni gelteechi ifi ugudhdha no'oxxi reyyeka manna reyotenaa'ni ke'isaake Mageno'nite malee'e no'oxxe hunnanite kadebaaxxa egenanoshshateni. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Magen no'o fuggoxxe reyonaa'n gatisi'een; gatisa, Edi'anna gatisaaxxa adde no'oxxi iso'nit. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Ha'nonna no'o'o soodachchoti gargartino'a hasisaani. Mayye'e? Heddo mannixxe soodachchonni Magen no'oo qarqaara wodda heddi mann no'oxxe Mageno galateefataani.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Me'atika Yaada Jijiidhdheexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />No'o ifi saadaanexxi yaane dhugaate kadeexxa wodani no'ok dhugga no'o kula'neeni. Tenne butta'ni he'nenexxi hedhdho no'oxxi giddii'ninni ha'noni welti hexxexxi afeenshsha Magenbaa'ni alfinenexxe woyyumaninna qajeelumati hana jaarendeexxenni. Tinninna kadeechchi Magenke badhaadhinite malee'e manjinke beekuminitebaan. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Haasesitineexxi qalbefachcho dandetinaaxxe yaane kaddole malee'e wele mittelchonna hano'o borresinabe'no; duuchchiinxa qalbefatinaaxxa addatano. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Ta'a ha'no hanii'n calla egendineexxi uduma kinni duuchchiinxa yaane egendinaaxxa addantaaneni; tennenaa'ni kexxexxa Gootti Yessuusi dagaaxxe barra'n no'o ha'no'n ifisaandanon; ha'nonna no'o'ni ifisaadinaan.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Tinni yaane duuchchi itta kadaaxxa ege'nenaxxe'e lamele la'o alfitinaashsha hiyyenexxi ediseneexxi ha'no'o dageenexxi uudona'a mudheenaani. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ha'nobaa'n Meqedooniya'a sa'ano wodda hano'o uudona'a, iitanni Maqadonnaa'n ha'noba ille iima hige Yihudake bogibaa me'ano wodda ane'e gargartinaaxxa hedenne. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Tenne yaane iitta murenno wodda hedebe'nok assenelcho ha'non labbaata? Yookaani buttatike mannisha «Eet, eet» hiyye jijirenexxi, «Waawwo, waawwo» hiyyanocho ha'no labbaata? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Magen addatemeeke kademaxxe, no'o ha'non kulenek hiyyichchi «Eettinna waawo» hiyyaake hiyyichobaan. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Tinninna kaddaachchi ani, Sillaasinna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girkeeke Silwaanosi hita</char></note> Ximotoosi Magenka belto Yessuusi Kiristoosixxe lallanbenek, «Eetti» hiyyaake hiyyichcho mallee'e, «Eettinna waawo» hiyyaake hiyyichchintebaan. Iso'ni duuchchi wodda eetiten. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Magen no'o'a uwwexxi adde duuchcha «Eettite» kadaachi Kirsitoosi ga'minteni. Tennexxeeteni Magenoke ulfinni Kirsitoosini gamii'ni «Ameen» hinanolchi. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />No'onna hano'onna Kiristoosi'n jabaanosha asseek Magenokeni; isike kandanoshanna no'o hariireekinna isoten. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Isike kandenaxxe'e dhuga leelishaaka ifika Woyyichchia Hafuura, edi'a alfinanoxxe yaaneka abidilsha qalbe no'oxxi giddo ugeek isoten.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Ani Qorontoosi'a illeema higenexxi daga gopheenelchi ha'no'o yaadisabo'noshatemaani. Tinnenne'anna dhugaa anxi Magenoken. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Ha'no amana ha'noxxe'ni jabaatineke manna kadinemaxxe'e ha'noxxe gammasho'a ha'noni welti hunjeenne malee'e amana ha'noxxe'n no'o ha'no'o ajanjabe'non.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ani ha'no'o yaadisabe'noshsha hediyooti langaxxa ha'noba'a dagabe'noshsha mudheenan. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Yoonna, ani ha'no'o yaadiseneexxe kaddole yaadisenenge ha'note malle'e weli mann ane'e gammachisaaki ayyeete? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ani ha'no'a itta borreeseneelchi ha'noba'a dagano wodda ane'e gammachchisa hassissaak manni ane'e yaadisabaasha hiyyeteni. Anxi gammasho kinni ha'no duuchchingixxe gammasho kadeexxa amana'enne. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Lumoxxe yaadoni, qalbeti wixixiyat indido dunaa'ni ha'no'a borreeseneelchchi lumoqico ha'no eeyaannexxa egendinaashsha hiyyeete malle'e ha'no'o yaadisona'a hiyyetebaan.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balleesanjoke'e Gattowaali Hiyyo Hasisaaxxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ayyinna manji yaadisoole ani yaane eebisahatee kadebaag iikk manji yadisseke ane calla kadebe'nog heenoqicinte kaddoolenna ha'no duuchingen. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Itta hedhheeke manji'a, ha'no giddi'ni heddi mann uwweek mura woxxa gelte'een. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Kaddolenna, isi lumo qico yaadiyotenaa'ni kexxeexxa haranga godoba kultabaasha ta'a langaaxxa higineexxi gattowaali hiyyiyoti dayeesiyyo hasisaani. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Iittanni iso'o eetina'neexxa kokkesitino'a ha'no kadhata'enen. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Eetenne erga ha'no'a borreeseneelchi duuchchinxenni ajajendina'nexxa ha'no'o hega uudona'a hiyyeten. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ha'no gattowaali hitinaake manjichi'a aninna gattowaali hiyyanoni. Isi'a gattowaali hiyyendaaxxi balleesa hexxexxe kaddole ani Kiristoosi edo isi'a gattowaali hiyyanelchchi ha'noxxeten. <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />Tenne asaanelchi Seexanxa shokko egenenaxxe'e Seexanni bakka alfabaashsha hiyyeeten.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosixxa Qoxxiyya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Kiristoosixxa wengeele lalabona'a Xiro'aadaka qachcha geyyene wodda Gootti ba'laxxa ergatenshatixxa hula ani'a banneeman. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Yaane kinni dayyo anka Titoo'o afa gophenaxxe'e qoxxiyene. Ani ookko hexxexxa addatameeyye, «Nage'ik hedhdhe» hiyyeneexxi Meqedooniyake bogibaa me'eneeni.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirston Afendaaxxa Injifacho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Kaddolenna, no'o duuchchi wodda Kiristoosinni injifantanoke asseexxi no'o'o akeeka'nekenna eloka foole afeexxe shittoshsha Kirsitoosixxe anfeenexxa ege'na bonchcho duuchcha'ni geesinsanooshsha asa'neeke Magen'a galati gewowaali! <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />No'o anjiremakenna kado'o, ba'aakeri'a Magenoke Kiristoosixxe fishen. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ba'aake mann'a, no'o shiyyaake foole kandeeneeni; fayyaake manni'a kinni hedhdho uwwake hedhdhotike foole kandeeneni. Yoona tenne ergatenshsha'a geyyaki ayyete? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />No'oqa Magenka hiyyichcho dadalinke miyishsha asinaa'ni dadalamake heddi mannishatebaani; luqqitte qalbenni no'o Magenbaa'ni ergemeeneke Kirsitoosixxe erganjuwwa kandeneexxi Magen edo dhugaati haasonan.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Harooxxe Kakkoka Eriganootta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Higeeni no'o umo no'oka galateefantona'a ke'nanno? Yookaani mitti mitti mann asa'neeshsha ha'no yookaani ha'nonaa'ni borreesendeexxi galatiinxi borro no'o'a hasisa? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Ha'noqa manji duuchchi ege'na'neekenna haasesa'nexxe qalbe no'oxxi giddo borreesendeexxi borro no'oxxi ha'noteni. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Ha'no umo ha'nongeenini borrotishshateni. Kiristoosibaa'n dagineexxe eriga kadineexxa ege'nendeexxeni. Tinni eriganna borreesendeeki hedhdho afeeke Magenke hafuurinte malle'e qalametitebaani. Ittani borreesendeekinna manjiinxe qalibee'nite mallee kinjoke'nitebaani.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Kiristoosi gamii'ninna Magenoke'n no'o iitta hexxeexxa adde anfe'ene. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Tenne yaane asiyyote'e gennanosha dande'a no'o'a uwa'neki Magenoke malle'e no'o umo no'oke mittelchonna assiyyote'e dande'a anfebe'non. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Fidalk borreesendeexxe kakonte kadebaak Woyyichchi Hafuur borresendeexxe haaroxxe kakko'a ergatemanoshsha no'o geesiseek kinni Magenoken. Tinninna kadaachchi fidalk borreesendexxi kako rewote'n geesisaani; woyyichchi Hafuuri kinni hedhdhote uwwa.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Seer borreesendeek kinjoke'n hana borrotitemaani; seeri uwwemeema wodda Magenki ulfini cala cala hiyyiyyoti lelleeni. Fedhdhe qiconna Muuseke albaa'n cala cala hiyyamaaki ifi heeno'ma'n me'eexxe kaddoolenna Isira'eelik ardi Muusseka alba dhaphphi hiyye'e uudatee dande'ebaan. Rewote'e geesisaaki seeri konne orike ulfinini lelleexxini, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Yoona, woyyichchi hafuuri gami'ni afendaaxxi erigatenshsha hitteqico sa'eeke ulfinna affuta? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Mann murte adhaaxxi erigatenshsha konne ulfinna afeexxeni, mann fayaaxxi erigatenshsha hitte qico sa'eeka ulfinna affa gophphaata? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Edi wodda ulfata'emak ta'a caala ulfinna afe'eken welt heregema wodda ulfinna afebaake kade'een. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Iikk baxxama ulfinni konne qico ulfinna afeexxeni yoona duuchchi woddi'a hedhaak ulfinnita caala ulfaata gopha?.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Iitta hexxeexxa adde anfenaxxe'e afo'o wo'mine haasonanon. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />No'o ookkone uuduma ba'aaka ifike albika ulfinna Isira'eelito uuddabaashsha seemat alba ifika buqedhemake Muuseshateba'a. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Insa'nek yaadi dhugaandinni dillo'e'en. Telchchi qico'ni siretixxa kakkoka Maxaafa haasosinna wodda; yaadi insa'neki eetenne seemmani buqeme'emashan hedheman; ikki buqe'emalchi hoyyemaak kinni Kirsitoosi callinteni. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Telchchi qico'nitenna kaddole Muusseka seera haasesinna wodda yaadi insa'nek ookone buqe'emalchinni buqeme'eni. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Fedhdheki manji Goottiba'a higa wodda kinni buqemalch itti hoyyendaani. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Gootti Hafuurakeni, Goottik Hafuur hedheeba garbunte hexxeba'a. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Ta'a kinni no'o buqemebaake albini Goottinka ulfinna da'witetisha calalasinanon; isixxa bifa lanbano'a ulfinakenaa'n ulfinba'a jijiremanon; tinninna kaddaachi Hafuurake kade'eke Gootti'niten.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Dhugaatik Eriganjika Ergatensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Magen mararte ifixxenni tenne'e ergatensha no'o'ni uwwemaxxe'e godoba kultinabe'no. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Sho'ondeexxenna shookishshaaxxe kadeexxa yaane waallenneni; shokoti hunjabe'noni; Magenka hiyyichchonna dharki welti karisinabe'no. Tenne irra Magen edo dhugaa ifinse leelinsha'n umo no'oka manji duuchchike wodani'a Magen edo luqasino. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Odeesinenexx wengele sho'ondeexxe kaddole sho'ondeechi ba'aake manni'a callani. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Insa'ne aman gonpheechchi Mageniinxe bifi kadde'exxa Kiristoosike ulfinke wengeleka ifi undabaashsha tenne buttak mageni amanandabaaxxa insa'nexxa sammo duuchemaxxeten. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />No'o Yessuusi Kiristoosixxe Gootta kaddeexxa malee ifi lalaba'be'no. Gootta Yesuus Kirstoosxe no'o ha'no'a ifi erganjuwwake assinano. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />«Ifi dukannati giddo ifowwaali!» hiyyeexxi haaso'eemak Magen Kiristoosixxe bifanni ookkonee ifaaka Mageniinka ulfinna ege'ntika ifa no'aa uwwo'a iikki ifi no'oxxe qalbe'n ifaashsha asse.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />No'o ulfeesendeexxa tenne yaane anfeeneki mann faarinke miyini hujemeeke miyishshateni. Tinninna itta kadeechchi lumoxxi hunna Mageniinxe mallee no'oxxe kadebaaxxa ege'nendaashaateni. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Ora oranaa'nini rakko no'o'ni geltaani; yaane kinni injifatemabo'noni. Heddo yanna memmi hinnanoni; yaane kinni godoba kultinabe'no. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Naaphi no'o shorshan yaane kinni jaaluwwa gonph egenebe'no gannemme inbanooni, yaane kinni rennabe'n. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Yessuusixxi hedhdho manjjunte no'oxxe'ni leelitaashsha duuchchi wodda Yessuussixxa rewo manjjunte no'oxxe'ni dulkinne mareemaanneni. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Isixxi hedhdho tennee rertaaxxe no'oxxe manjjunte'n leellito'a ta'a no'o hedhdhoti he'nennek duuchchi wodda Yessuusixxe'e reyotee sa'issemmee uwwemmannoni. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Iitta kadeexxini no'o rewote'e sa'isemennexxi he'nanno wodda ha'no hedhdhoti hexxinaani.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Kaddo malee'e, «Amanene tennexxenna haaso'enne» hiyyende borreesendemashanni; no'onna ookkonne mitte amanatka hafuura anfeenaxxe'e amanaane; tennexxenna haasonaane. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Gootta Yessuusii'i reyotenaa'n ke'iseemak Magen no'onna Yessusinni welti ke'isaaxxanna ha'noni welti isi edo shiqishshaxxa egenneneni. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Tinni duuchcha ha'no'a la'ote kadek badhaadh bira sa'e heddi mann'a geyemashanni Magenoke'e ulfinni'a kadaak galati bira sa'ashaten.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanati Hedha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Tennexxe adde no'oxxa goonfabe'no; gadhixxi manjunnite baxxole giddixxi no'oxxi manjunte no'oxxin kinni barra barrande'ni haaro'maan. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Tinni shollaxinna yannatixxi no'oxxi rakko; haraanga lumoke kadeeka duuchchi Woddika ulfinna no'o'a afisaani. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />No'o uundanek leelitabaaxxe yaane malle'e, tenne leelita'nexxebaani. Tinni leelitaaxxi yaanenna yannatixxen; yaane kinn leelitabaaxxi yaane duuchchi woddixxeni.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Iimika No'oka Mine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Kunni yannatike duunkaanishsha kadeek buttatik maali no'oki diigema wodda manjinxe angante kadebaangi Magenxe angaani ijaaremeeki duuchchi woddiki mini iima no'o hedhdhexxa egeneneeni. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Iima hedheka no'oka mine seemmatishsha odo'wiyote'e quqquxema'ni foo'late'ni he'nenneni. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Ookkonne no'oka mine seemmatishsha odo'winaanno wodda duwwiti he'nabe'noni. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Konne buttike duunkaana kadeeke maali no'oki giddo he'nanno wodda, no'o'n a'uree'na'a foo'linaaneni. Foo'linaanelchinna iikki reyamak hedhdhoti liqisemasha iimika no'oka mine odo'wiyyote'e malee duwwiti gantona'atebaan. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Tenne yeene'a no'o'a qixxeseeki Magenokeni. Heger no'o'a uwwendaaxxe yaane'anna abidlshake kadaashsha Woyyichcha Hafuura no'o'a uwweki isoten.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Tennexxe buttatik bisi no'oknn he'neneqico'ni Goottakena'n bayyantenxa egenonolenna midde duuchchi wodda addante he'nano. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />No'o he'nanelchi amanatite malee'e iso'o uudatitebaani. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Konne he'naneeke minsha hedheeke no'oke maalanaa'n gargarit hingeneexxi Gotti welti he'nona'a fi'linnanoxxa afo'o wo'me haaso'anen. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Konne maali no'oken he'nonnole yookaani konne maalanaa'ni gargariti hingonoole yorte no'oxxi Gootta gammachisiyoteni. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Mitti mitti no'onigi buttate'ni hunjennexxe hujenxe eloxxeenna kaddo elobaaxxe hunjenaxxe hujeka hira alfaatee Kiristoosixxe murtetixxe moote edo shinqaanoni.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Araarsatixxa Ergatensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Mageno soddata maachcho kadeexxa egennenaxxe'e mannake'e kullaneni. Magen no'oxa ayyunte ege'ne'eni ha'nonna qalbe ha'noxxenne egendinaxa addantanon. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Qalibete'ni hexxexxe yaanenaa'nite kaddebaangi leelitaaxxe yaane'ni ifi saadake'e hiisa dandeetinasha; ittanni ha'no no'o'ni ifi saadinasha no'o ha'no'a daafeete kandona'ate malee'e higgen no'o ha'oxxe'e galateefatemona'atebaani. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Maraatake kandonole; Magenoke hinneteni; wodannke manna kandonole kinni ha'no'a hinneteni. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Mittele Kiristoosi duuchchingee reyexxanna duuchchingi mann isixxa rewo qoodemaake kadeexxa egenenaxxe; Kirsitoosixxi eeyunte no'o hujete'e tirtirisita'neeni. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Hedhoti hedheeki mann duuchchi insa'ne'a reyekeenna rewotenaa'ni ke'emakee'e hedhashshate malee'e konnechchini edi'a mann umo ifikee hedhabaasha Kirsitoos duuchchinge'e reyeni.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Tennexxee konnechchin edi'a ayyeenna maalnxe uushonni uundabe'no. Konnechchini edi darrenna Kiristoosii'i uundeneeki maalinxe uushontenna kaddole midde yoona konechchini edi'a uundanoki konne orintebaani. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Tennexxee ayyinna Kirsitoosini mittomoole isi haarooxxe dadani. Dullate dada saxxe'eni; kunse haaroxxe dada kade'een. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Tinni duuchchi kadeechchi; no'o isini welti Kiristoosi gamii'n arraariseekenna arraarinxa erigatensha uwweke Magenonaa'niteni. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Tinninna, Magen Kirsitoosi gami'ni manjo duuchcha isini welti arariseeni hiyyoteni. Balleesa insa'nexxanna laako'ebaani; no'o'anna araarisatika hiyyichcho uwwe'eni. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Tennexxee no'o Kiristoosixxe tukkuwwan; Magen no'o gami'n manna ye'aan; no'onna ha'no'o «Magenk welti araareeme!» hinenexxi Kirsitoosike summini kadhantaanon. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />No'o Kirsitoosini welti mitteba higati Magenxa qullumma alfinanoshsha; Magen cubbo afebaaka Kirsitoosi'i no'oxxa cubbo dulkaashsha asseeni.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Magenki welti mitteba hunjaaneke kandennaxxe; Adhitineeki badhaadhi butta gattoqe'e! Hine'e ha'no kadhantaanneni. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Mageni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">«Eyendeexxe yanna'n atixxa laqeenneni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">anjiratixxa barra'ni ate'e gargaarene» hiyyaamaxxe'e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Yoona eyendexxi yanna ta'ateni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">anjiratixxi barranna ta'ate.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Ergatensha no'oxxi jibeendabaasha; fedhexxe yanna'ni fedheekee gufote kandabe'noni. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Iitta assati irra shorcho, yaado, seldonna rakko duuchcha'ni ossina'ni Magenoke'e erigatemaneeke kandeneexxa duuchchini gami'ni leelinshanoni. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Jadhafemati, usuremati, raankemat, hujete'ni fiidi hiyyat, diipho gophatinna solo'ik, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />qullumat, ege'nati, ossuunteeti, elleti, Woyyichchi Hafuuriniinna dhugaatixxe eeyunteni, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Dhugaatike hiyyichchinni, Magenxe hunnanni, middakenna bit'ake kadaake qullicha loliinke miyi'n, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Ulfink yookaan salphinake'e, eloke yookaan elobaake summa adhdhatee qopheefanteneni. Dhugaatinge kandaano wodda, sonba'neeke hiyyyemeneeni. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Ege'nemeenge kande'e ege'nemebo'nosha kandeeneni. «Renneni» hiyyemanno wodda hedhoti he'nanoni; ganemonolenna rennabo'noni. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Yaado no'o'ni geltollenna duuchchi wodda gammandaaneni. Hiyyeeyende kande he'nennexxi heddo manna durreeyete asinaanneni. Mittelchonna afebaake manna kandonollenna; duuchchingeechi no'okeni. <verse eid="2CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Ha'no koo Qorontoosi hexxina'neeke mann! Farri assine'e ha'no'a kullaneeni; qalbe no'oxxa ha'no'a ba'linse banneneneni. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Qalbe ha'noxxa no'o'ni cu'misinne malee'e; no'o qalbe no'oxxa ha'no'ni cu'minsebo'noni. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ani oose ifixxe'e haaso'amashanni aninna ha'no'a haaso'ole, no'o qalbe no'oxxa ha'no'a banneneshanni ha'nona qalbe ha'nooxxa no'a banne!<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanabake Mannini Welti Guddagopha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Kadabaake orini amanabake manninni welti mittondinoqe'e! Qulumatinna cubbo hitta weli mittomate'e dandeeta? Ifikinna dukannati mitteba hedha dandeetata? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kiristoosi Duriisik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Durrsake hiyyemeek hiyyichi Girikeke'n «Beliyal» yookaan «Beliyar» hiyyemaake kada wodda tikatinna wafulabaacho hiyyote kada wodda kunninna Seexanike wele summan. </char></note> welt hitta wel aago dandeesisata? Amanaakinna amanabaaki maa mittunte afe? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Magenk Galminna dharchi magen maa mittoma anfeeta? Magenkinna hiyya'neqic,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Insa'ne'n galano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">«Ani insa'nxe oddo'ni mammaremanoni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Ani insa'neke Mageno kadanooni. Insa'nenna anke arda kandaani» Hiyyeexxi haaso'emashanni no'o mitti mitting hedhaake Magenke Galman.<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />«Tennexxe insa'ne giddi'ni gargarti higineexxi fulle!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Ani'a foyendineke kadde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">hiyya'neen Duuchchi Woddik Gootti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Batte yaane tuqinoqe'e!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ha'no'onna anke kaddinaan.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Ani ha'noke anna kadanoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">Ha'nonna anxe meyyaxxenna labbaaxxe oose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">kadinaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">hiyya'nen duuchinxa dande'aak Gootti.»<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Yoona anke jaaluwwa! Konne addachchisatika hiyyichcho anfe'enaxxe maalakanna irra no'oka battoositaxxe fedhexxe yaanenaa'n umo no'oka ifi luqqasino! Mageno sodaatati woyyumma no'oxxa womate kaddaashsha assino.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosixxa Gammashsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Godoba no'o'a ba'late! Ayyeenna balleesinebo'noni; ayyeenna miinebo'noni; ayyeena'ninna saamebo'non. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Aninna tenne ha'no'ni hiyyanelchi; ha'no'ni murrite murona'atebaani. Konnechchi edo ha'no'ni kullenshanni; ha'no qalbe no'oxxi giddo hexxinen; hedhotinna kaddo'o, rewotinna kaddo'o duuchchi wodda ha'noni welti he'nannoni. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ani ha'no lummoqico addatanon; ha'noxxe'e lummoshsha ifi saadanen; ittani yo'oshsha dayyefatene; rakko no'oxxe duuchcha'ni gammasho anxinna bira saxxexxeni.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Meqedooniya gennenne wodda heddo tooranaa'ni rakko no'o'ni geltemaxxe'e; hafuura adhinebo'noni; gadhi'ni naaphunte, no'oni giddonna soda'ate hexxemani. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Yaane kinni yadeeka dayyesak Magen Titoxxe daga'n no'o dayyeese. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />No'o dayyesemenlchinna isixxe daga'nite calla kaddebangi; ha'no iso'o dayyesitinxa laqiyoti weltiteeni. Ha'no ani'a afineexxa quqquxensha yaadonna rakko; ittani no'o'a hitta garigaryote'e qixxefatinnexxa kulle wodda; saxxeexxa gammadeneeni.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Fedheqiconna konnechchi edi darre ha'no'a borreesseneexxi erga ha'no'o yaadisexxenna kaddole ani borreeseneexxe hansha hiyyabe'no. Hansha hiyyenexxe kaddolenna midde erga anxi ha'no yaadiseek heenoxxe yanna calli'ate kaddeexxa ege'neenen. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ta'a kinni gammadenneni; gammadeennelchinna ha'no yaadisennexxete kadebaangi; yaado ha'noxxixxe buutonni aadde agineexxi jijjirendinnexxeteni. Yaado ha'noxxi Magenke ajajishshate kademaxxe'e; no'o ha'no'o mittelchonna balleesinebo'noni hiyyiyyoteni. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Magenxe fedhiisha kaddaaxxi yaado hansha affebaaxxa, anjirnshatiba gesisaaxxa aadde agiyyote'e geesisan. Tenne buttaxxi yaado kinni rewote iyyedagaani. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Yoona, Magenxe fedhiin kaddeexxi tinni ha'noxxi yaado hitta si'a, hitatadheeka faachefachotka hiisichcho, hitta hexxeexxa mufe, hitta hexxeexxa soda'a, hitta hexxeexxa halcha, hitta hinaafe hita hexxeexxa fuggoxxe mura woxxisa ha'noxxe oddo'n kaddaashsha assiteexxe ege'ne. Duuchin darre tenne yaane'e balleesabelsabelo kadineexxa kokeesitine'en. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ani iitta ha'no'a borreesenlchi; no'o'a afine'eki jabeeni Magen edo ha'no'ni farri hiyye leelaashsha hiyyete malee'e; miicekixenna miicemebaakixxe hiyyetebaan. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Dayyefacho no'oxxi irra Titoke gammado'ni no'onna yo'osha gammandeenen. Gammandenlchinna ha'no duuchching Titoo'o dayyesitinmaxxenna irra isika ti'ni assitinemaxxeten. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ani ha'no'ni afenexxa ifi saada Tito'n kullenneni. Ha'nonna ane'e shokishinebaani; duuchchi wodda dhugaate ha'no'ni kulleeneni; iittanni ha'noxxe'e ifisada'n Tito'n kulleneexxi yaane dhugaate kaddeexxa kokeesende'een. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ha'no duuchchingi ajajendinaa'n, soda'atinna roqonsaati Tito'o adhdhitinqico kassi hiyyano wodda ha'no'a afee'exxi eeyunte lummoqico bira saxxe'eexxe kade'eni. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Aninna duuchchini gami'ni ha'no'ni adde assedhati yo'osha gammadeenen.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ifixxe Eeyan Uunaxxa Uwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Anke dayyuwwa Magen Meqedooniya hexxeexxe amanye'a uwweka badhadha egendino'a hansaaneen. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Insa'nenna heddo rakkonni hega uudeme'eke kando gamasho insa'nexxi kinni birsaxxeexxe; buxano hiyyeeyye kanden he'nexxi arjuma birasa'inse. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Dandenqico calla kadebabaangi; hunna insa'nexxi iimi darre eeyyunte insa'nexxini uunnexxa insa'nexxe'e dhuga'a kulaanen. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Qulliyye gargaratixxe ergatensha qoodemo'a jabeesine no'o kadhante'en. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Edinseexxi umo ifika Gootti'a uunnen. Ooko'n lenbeexxi Magenoke hasitishaani umo ifika no'o'anna uunneni. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Tenne huje edissexxi safekeek Titote kademaxxee; ta'anna tenne'e ha'noxxe eeyuntetixxa huje bakka geesisaashsha isonde kadhanteeneni. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Ha'no amanati, haaso'ik, ege'nati, si'ik, no'o'a afinnexxe eeyyuntetinna duuchchinxe yaaneni welekenaa'n saxxine'en. Tenne arjuntetixxe ergatennshainna qubasaxineeke kadde.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ani tenne ha'no'a hiyyiyyo anxi ajajikitebaani; yaane kinn wele mannka uwwatika jabeenna ha'noke jabeenini welti qixxeesat. Ha'nooxxe eeyaxxa dhuga'a kokeesate'e hiyyeten. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ha'no Gootta no'okixxa Yessuusi kiristoosika badhaadha egendine'eni. Isi fedheekiqocanna dureesakenna kadoole isixxe hiyyumanni ha'no dureeyete kaddinaasha ha'nooxxe'e isi hiyyesake kade. <verse eid="2CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Tenne yaane'ni ane'n eloxxe fakkaate leeliteexxe yaane ha'no gorsaanen; saxxexxe wogga'n uwwaate calla kaddebang tenne assate hedati sirete'n saffineek ha'noten. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Tennexxee eeyente ifixinni uwwate'e hassinmak yaada hujete'ni hose'na'a muuxamiba geeyasha affinxe hunnanni ookone'e heddineka yaada ta'a asse. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Manji mitti uwwate'e hassoole; uwwa isixxi adhdhendak afeexxe hunnaqico'ni uwwolleete malee'e; afebaaxxe hunnani uwwoletebaani. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Itta hiyyanno wodda; ha'no duuchchingi weli qixxotino'ate malee'e; ha'no uwwati rakkatinna wodda; weli hafura adhdho'a hiyyetebaani. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Ha'no rakkatinna wodda; insa'nexxi karra ha'noxxa rakko hosiisaashsha; ta'a ha'noxxi karra rakko insa'nexxa hosiissowaali! Konne toorini ha'noxxe oddo'ni qixxunte hexxani. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Tinninna, «Bira sa'isse bukki assedheeki geye gatebaan; shixxoka bukki assedhekena'ninna xe'yitebaani» hiyyende borresendeeshaten.<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Titonna Jaalluwwa Isika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Ani ha'no'a hedaneshanni Titonna ha'no'a hedaasha asseke Mageni'a galati geyowaal! <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Tito ha'noba'a daga'nechchi; eeyyunte ifixxenaa'ni kexxexxe gammashonte malee'e; no'o kadhantenexxe callabaani. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Isinni welti wengeele lallabat Beetekirsitaan duuchcha'ni ulfeesemeka dayyo isinnii welti erginaanen. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Tenne iimdarre kunni dayyi, no'o tenne eloxxa huje Goottike ulfin'a muunxano woddanna ergatemate'e anfeneka eloxa fedhii'i leelnshano wodda isi no'on welti me'ati huje no'oxxa qoodemasha Beetekirsitanetena'ni filemeken. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Konne uwwemeeka maalaqa hujete'ni hosiinsaano wodda; mitte hametixxi gungunsso no'o'ni geltabaashsha xexxe'antanooni. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Hedumi no'oki Gootti edo calla kadebaangi; mann edonna elloxxe kadeexxa yaane assiyyoteeteni.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Heddo oranaa'ni heddole hega uudemeexxi; jabaake kadeexxi afemeeka dayyo no'oka Titoorni welti eriginennelchi tennexxeeteni. Isi ha'no'ni afeexxi amana lummoxxe kademaxxe'e; ta'a ha'no'o garigaaryote'e konnechchi edi irra jabaate'eni. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Titote kaddole; isi ha'no'o garigaaryote'e aninni welti huja'neeke anke hujetike jaaloni. Isini welti daga'neeke wele dayyuwwanna kaddole; Beetekrsitaantena'ni tukkesemek erganjuwwanna Kiristoosik ulfini'a uurekeeran. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Yoona ha'nonna, eeya ha'noxxa insa'ne'a leelshe! Konne toorini eeya ha'noxxeninna ha'no'ni ifinxi ifi saada toleenxe kaddebaaxxa Beetekirsitaan duuchchi'a leelshinani.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Kirsitoositote'e Buki Asineexxa Uuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Qulliyyete assemaake gargarsixxee ani ha'no'a borreessa hasisaba'a. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ha'no Akkaayiyaake boga'n hexxineek manni gargarsake afineexxa hinaaffe ege'nenaxxe'e «Akkaayiyaak mann saxxexxe wogganaa'ni ke'iseexxi gargariyyote'e qixxefate'eeni» hiyyeneexxi ha'noxxe Meqedooniyake manna'n ifi saada'ni kulleeneeni. Tinni ha'no garigariyyote'e afineexxi si'a heddo manna onnosit'e ke'isete'een. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Yaane kinni ha'noni ifi saadaneexxi saadino itta tolake kade'e gatabaashsha konne dayyuwwa ha'noba'a erigineeneni; konnechi edi darre kullenaashaani qixxefatineexxi heqqe. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Meqedooniyak mann anini welti ha'noba'a dageexxi qixxefatinebaake kaddineexxa afoole; ha'no'ni holinenaaxxe'e shoonkanoni; ha'nofa'i lumo qico shookinaani. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Tennexxee uwwiyote'e weli aaginemaaka edisineexxi qixxeesitinaashsha kassi assona'a hiyyiyyoti ediseneexxi dayyuwwi kunn ha'noba'a dagaashsha aseneeni. Konne toorini ani dagaano wodda uwwa ha'noxxa qixxesitine heqitinaani; ha'nonna uutina'neek eeyya ha'noxxinite malle'e hunnati kadebaaxxa leelishaan.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />«Hennoka facaaseek hennonge buki asedhdhani lummoka facaaseeki kinni lummonge buki asedhdhani» hiyyemaka hiyyichcho kassi hiyye! <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Magen eeyyaki gammashshoti uwwake manjoni. Tennexxee mitti mittinigi uwwate'e haseechcho qalbete'ni heddexxi gammashshoti uwwo'o yaada'n yookaani gamada'nebaak uwwoqe'e! <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Duuchchinxe yanna'a gayaaka alfitineexxi elloxxe huje duuchcha'ni hosisate geyaasha Magen birasa'iseexxi eeba isixxa uwwiyyote'e dande'aani. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Tinninna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">«Hiyyeyyete'e arjoome uwweni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">qulluma isixxinna duuchchi wodda hexxaani» hiyyende borreesendemashshanden.<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Ittani facasaake sanne, itate'e waassa uwwaki Magen; facasinaaxxa sanne birasa'ise'e ha'no'a uwwani. Ha'noxxa arjumatixxa gummanna bira sa'isaani. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Arjunteeti uutina'nexxa uwwa no'o daree'ni adhdha'neeki mann duuchchi Mageno galatefataashsha duuchchi wodda arjunteeti uutinaashsha Magen duuchchiinxe yaanneni ha'no'o durroonsaani. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Tinni ha'no uutina'neexxe uwwaxxi ergatenshsha amaagnetixxa rakko hoyyiyyatenaa'n saxxaaxxen; Magenoke'e lummmoka galata shiqiinshaashsha asitaani. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Tenne ha'noxxe arijunteeti uwwatixxe erigatenshshani Kiristoosixxa wengeele adhdhitinne'e addatineeke kadineexxa wele manni'anna ege'nishshamaxxe'e mann Mageno saadaani; ittani insa'ne'anna wele mann duuchchi'a arijunteti uwwitmaxxe uwwaaxxe Mageno ulfesinaan. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Insa'nenna Magen ha'no'a uwweke lummoke badhaadhdhanaa'ni kexxexxa ha'no eenemaxxe'e ha'no'a soodantta'neeni. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Konne qicon hiyyendeexxi kullendabaaxxe isixxe uwwa Mageno galati gewowaali!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Phawuloos Ergatensha Fachfacho'a uwweeka Hissicho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Ani Phawuloosi ha'non welti hedhdhenna wodda, shaqake kadeenek ta'a ha'no biri'n bayyatano wodda jabataanek kinni ha'no'o Kiristoosixxe shaquntenninna sigguman ha'no kadhdhataanen. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ha'no kadhdhataanelchinna ha'noba'a dagano wodda jabaate haaso'nosha ane'e asitinabaashshateni. Yaane kinn «Phawuloosi maalinke hedumini akekeme huja'neeni» hiyyexxi hedaake mitti mitti manna'n jabaate haaso'a dande'anon. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Fedhdhe qiconna midde buttate'n he'nonnolenna no'o lallanok kaba buttike lolike lolintebaan. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />No'oki lollinki miyyinna kollo diigate'e dandesisaaxxa Magenumatixxe hunna afeekera malle'e buttatike lolinke miyyishshatebaani. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Magenxe ege'na'n ifi dukat kexxaaxxa moromanna la'o afebaa yaada duuchcha diingannoni. Manjiinka yaada duuchchanna boojinaa'ni Kiristoosi'a ajajemaashsha assinaanon. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Ha'no hara ajajeenidineeke kadinexxa egenenelchini uduma ajajemagopha mura woxisate qophphefantanon.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Ha'no uudina'nexxi gadhdhixxe yaane calaani; fedhdheki manji «Ani Kiristoosiken» hiyyexxi heddoole no'onna isishshani Kiristoosike kandenexxa kokowwaal. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Gootti no'o'a uwweek baalom lummo qico ifisaando shokabe'noni; tinni dande'a no'o'a uwwendeechchi ha'no jarona'ate malle'e diigatetebaani. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Tenne anxe borreese ha'no'a soddaachisaanelcho laboqqe'e. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Mitti mitti mann «Phphawuloosixxi eriga a'uriteexxenna jabaaxxeni; isi no'oni hedhmadhama wodda kinni gophphalleesakeni; haaso'i iskinna tufatemeeken» hiyyaxxe hexxen. <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Iitta hiyyaki mann kinni no'o bayyaani he'neneexxi borreesine eriginaanexxe erigaaninna ha'noni welti he'nenexxi hunijaanexxe hujeexxe oddo'ni mitte garigarti higa hexxebaaxxa egenowaali.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Kaddo malle'e, umo ifika galatefataake mitti mitti mannini welti umo no'oka herreengona'a hansabe'no; insa'ne weli weli herega'ni hokokisa'neke qalbeefacho afebaake mannanni. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />No'ote kandonole kinni Magen no'o'a gabale uwwexxe hujeexxe qixxe'n holinaano malle'e hasisabaaqico'ni holinabe'no'ni. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ha'no hexxineek no'oxxe hujexxe gabala giddo kademaxxe'e Kiristoosixxa wengeele lalabatee ha'noba'a dangenne wodda no'oxxe gabalanaa'ni sa'nebe'no. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Tennexxee Mageni no'o'a uwwexxe gabala'naa'ni sa'neneexxi wele mannixxe huje'ni hasisabaa qico'ni holinabe'noni; eettenne bakka adde ha'noxxi jabataashsha no'oxxi hujenna Magen no'o'a uwwexxe gabala'ni hano'oxxe oddo'ni yo'oshsha ba'lataashsha halichchinaaneeni. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Yoona wele manjixxe hjeexxe gabala e'yinennexxi edo hujendemaaxxe hujee'ni holinabo'noni; ha'no wididaare hedhdheke boguwike arda'ni wengele lalaba dandenaanoni. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Tinninna «Ifisadak Goottake'n ifi saadowaal!» hiyyendeexxi borreessendemashaaniden. <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Manji galatefatemate'e geyaachchi Magen isso'o eloke manjo kada isixxa dhuggesolete malle'e ifi'aani ifi galatee adhendba'a.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosinna Dhariyye Ergameeyye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Heenoxxa anxa gowunte anxa ositinaaxxa addatanoni; maganete ane'e osse. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Magenxe hinnafenni ha'no'o hinaafaaneni; hinnafaanelchinna; ha'no'o ci'medebaaxe duuddo dubbarichchoshsha mitte labbake kadhdhatenexxeteni; iikkinna Kiristoositen. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Bofi Heewaanii'i ifixxe shokkonni dedhisemasha akimaada yaadi ha'nook gore'na'a Kiristoosi'a afinexxi qajeeltonna ca'itte adatensha waaldinaan hiyye sodaata'enen. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Mitti manji ha'noba'a dageexxi no'o lallanbeenxe kaddebaangi; wele Yessuusii lallanbeexxe kaddole; yookaani ha'no adhdhitineeke hafuura kadebaangi wele hafuura adhdhitinoole; yookaani adhdhitineexxa wengeele waaldinxi wele wengeel adhdhitinole injifatendineen hiyyoten. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Yaane kinni Ani tenne lumolaamma ergameeyyenaa'ni fedheexxe yaaneninna shiixedhanno hiyye hedabe'noni. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Giise'e haaso'a gopheneexxe kaddolenna midde; ege'na kinni afeeneeni; tennenna heddi orni ha'no'ni farri assine'e ege'nisheneni.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ani Mageniixa wengele rundi belo ha'no'a lallaba anxinna ha'no'o lummisate'i ifi salphisiyyo akimagaada ane'ni cubbotishsha laako'enduu? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Ha'no'a erigatemona'a wele Beetekirsitiyanena'ni garigaarisa adhdhati insa'ne'e saameeneeni <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ani ha'noni welti hedhee'na'a rakko ane'ni gelte wodda; Meqedooniyanaa'n dageeki dayyuwwi ani'a hasisaaxxa yaane duuchcha'ni ane'e gargaaremaxxe'e ani ayye'ninna ba'ote kadebo'noni; ta'iqico'ni ha'no'ni fedheexxe yaane'a ba'ote kadebo'noni; edi'anna ha'no'ni ba'ote kadabo'noni. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Kiristoosixxi dhuga ani giddo hexxemaaxxe'e; ani ifi saadabo'nosha assaaki mann Akkaayiyaake boga'ni mittikinna hedhebaani. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Iitta hiyiyya anxi mayee'aate? Ha'noo eeyabo'noxxeete? Waawwo'o; ha'no'o eeyaneexxa Magen ege'ne'eeni.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Iiki weli erganjuwwi, «No'onna insa'nesha hunja'eneeni» hina'ni iif saanda'nexxa saadino balleesate'e ta'a hujaanexxa huje edi'aanna kinni hujanoni. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Iitta hedheeki mann Kiristoosixxe ergameeyye fakkatatee'e umo ifika jijjiira'neeke dhariyye ergameeyyenna xaqarticha hujaluwwan <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Tininna mambe'a assitaaxe yaanebaani; durrisi midde ifiinke erganjo fakkatati umo isika jijjidhani. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Iitta kadeexxeni, isik erganjuwwi qulliyye erganjuwwa fakkaatate'e umo insa'neka jijjireexxe kaddole tinni mambe'a assitaaxeban; hunje insa'nexika hira uduma alfinaan.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phaawuloosi'n Gelteexxa Rakko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />«Huun manjo'ni ani gowwake kadeneelcho iso'o fakkatoqee!» hiyye higgeeni ha'no'ni haaso'anee. Ani gowwake ha'no'ni fakkatonolna midde shiixxoxa yanna ifi saadona'a gowwinsha ane'e assitine uude. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Iitta ifi saada'ni haaso'ano wodda haaso'aneelchi Goottike hasitishate kaddebang ifi gowwak assedheeten. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Heddi mann maalinxe yaane gami'ni ifi saadamaxxe'e aninna ifi saadanon. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ha'no umo ha'nongini qarote kaddinemaxxe'e gowwole gammashoti ossitinaani. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ittaani ayyinna ha'no'o garbak assole, ayyinna ha'no saamole ayyinna ha'nooxxa la'o adhdhoole, ayyinna ha'no tuffatoole, ayyinna ha'no dhabanaasole ha'no tenne duuchcha'ni ossitinaani. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Fedheqico tinni ane'e shookishaaxxe yaannenna kaddole ha'noshsha ossiyotee'e jabake kandebenoxxa ha'no'ni kullaaneeni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Fedheki kinni ifi saadate'e ke'exxe kaddole; aninna isishann ifi saadanon. Tenne'e itta hiyyaanelchi gowwinsha kadeeteni. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Insa'ne Ibirayitotee? Aninna Ibirichchoken; insa'ne Isira'eelitotee? Aninna Isra'eelichchokeni; insa'ne Abirihaamixxe sannee? Aninna Abirihaamixxe sanneni. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Insa'ne Kiristoosi'a erigatema'neekera? Aninna insa'ne irra Kirsitoosi'a erigatemaanekeni; aninna tennenna itta hiyyano wodda maraaatek manjishsha kadeeten haaso'anek: insa'ne irra lumoqico hujete'ni ani elo'eenen; heddole usuremeene, heddole jadhafemeenen, heddole reye gatenen. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Ayihudiinxe anga'n sase tommenna salanele, halangeti ondele jadhafemenen. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Sasele dullik ganemenen, mitte yanna kinoti cancaqemenen, sasele lummoxxe hoboloxxi enqensha ane'ni gelteeni; mitte hashanna mitte barra abbaayyati giddo hedhenaani. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Orxe me'axxe bira sa'nena'ni wodi'inxinna lola'iinxi rakko ane'ni gelte, saamamak manninna rakko ane'ni geelte; Yihudake mannana'ninna Yihuda kadebake manni gamii'ni rakko ane'ni geelte. Qachchake'ni, qiila gamooje'ninna abbaayyate'ni rakko a'ne'ni gelte, iitaani dharye amanye gami'ni rakko ane'ni gelteeni. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Heddo hujeenna elo ane'ni hexxemaani; heddo yanna diiphpho gopheneeni; solo'ikinna woddiinxe dheebonni rakatenneni; heddo yanna ittanogechixxi gonphphe ane'ni gelteemani; daarkinna boojeti rakateneeni. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Wele yaane duuchcha laako'ebo'nongi betekirstaane duuchchi'a barra'n barra'n hediyyoti rakateneeni. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Mitti manji ifigoph wodda ani isini welti ifigophebe'no? Mitti manji cubbote'n gugufata wodda ani mubetebe'no woddi haanote?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Holla hasisa'neexxe kadeele ani hollanolchi gonphe anxa leellishaaxxe yaane'ni callateni. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Gootti no'ok Yessuusi Kirsitoosik anni Magenani sobaabe'noxxa ege'neen. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Demaasiqoke qachcha'n hedhdhenna wodda Arsixoosiyyoosi hiyyemaake moyanji hunda hedhdhemaaki arda galchchamaaki manjichchi ane'e abido'a haseexxi qachchiinxa hula heqanjiki heqiseemaani. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Yaane kinni manni kinjinke dala'ixxe hula gami'n ane'e qirco giddo ugeexxi dirisee'na'a anga isixxenaa'n fuleneeni.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Phawuloos Udeexxa waleella</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ifisadati la'o afema gophpholeenna ifi saada hasisaaxxe kaddole kinni Gootti ani'a ifiseexxe yaneninna uwweexxe waleella'n hollanoon. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Mitte Kirsitoosike kadeeka manjo ege'neeneni; kunni majichchi tommenna shoole wogga edidarre sakaaxxe iimaba'a adhemeeni; adheme qicinna mannjunte isixxeninide kaddu yookaan manjunte isixxenaa'ni garigart higeete kaddu ani ege'nebo'noni; Magono calla ege'neeni. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Yaane kinni kunni manjichchi gennetetibaa adhdhemeexxa ege'ne'ene; yaane manjunte kadi yookaani kada gophphuun ege'neebeo'non; Mageni ege'ne'een. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Kunni manjichchi ooko'o manjinke laagadinni ifisa dandesisabaaxxanna manjinke afo'ini haasoi'a dande'abaaxxe yaane laqeeni. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Iitta hedhdheke manjixxe'e ifisaadanon; an umo aniken kinni anxe ifi gophphe'aate kaddoole malee wele ifisadanoxxi yaane hexxebaani. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Dhuga haaso'enexxe ifi sadonolenna gowake kadabe'no; yaane kinni ayyinna ane'n uuda'neexxe yaane'ninna anenaa'n laqa'neexxe yaane irra ane'e uudamabe'noshsha ifisaadabe'no waalanon.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Ane'ni leeliteexxe tenne lummolama yaanenaa'ni kexxexxa ifisada'benosha; maala anka utetishsha otaaki uchchi an'a uwwemeeni. Kunni uchchinna durriisinke eriganjo kadeexxi ane'e ganaa'ni ifisadabe'nosha asa'neeni. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Tinni ane'ni wixxixxe assitaaxxi yaane anenaa'ni kexxaashsha Gootta sasele kadhdhatenneni. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Isi kinni ane'e, «Anxi hunna ati'a leelitaaki atixxe gonphphente kademaxxe badhdhaadhi anki ate'e geyyedhdheni» hiyye. Tennexxee Kiristoosixxi hunna ane'ni hexxashsha feetexxe yaane irra gonphe anxe'ni gammada'ni ifisaadano. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ani hunna afanolchchi ani ifi gophano woddate kademaxxe Kiristoosixxe elo'ano wodda, yowemanno wodda, wixixxiyano wodda, rakkatano wodda gamadannon.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phaawuloosi Qorontoosike Manni'a Yaadexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ani gowwinshsha haaso'eneeni; itta haaso'anoshsha asitineeki ha'noteni yaane kinni ha'no ani'a assa hassissamachchi anee galatefatemiyyotemaani; ayyete kadiyyo anxi ege'nenidebaake manjo kaddonole midde «Lummolamma» hiyyendeexxe ergameyyenaa'n mittichininna xe'yabe'no. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Dhuggatike erigaanjo kadda anxa ege'nshaaxxi yaannuwwa ani ha'noxxe oddo'ni hedheneexxi ossuunteti hujennexxe hujuwaani. Tirinninna beesisuwwa, masuwwanna manbe'uwwa yaanuwwamaan. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ha'no'n ba'ote kadebo'nong gatonole malee'e wele betekrstaane'naa'n ha'no'o shiixxishsheneeki mayyikite? Tinni balleesaate kaddexxi ane'ni laakko'endeexxe kaddole yoona ani'a gatowaali hiyye!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Ha'noba'a dagiyyote'e qixxeefata'na'a tinni sakaaxxe yannani; ani ha'no'ni ba'ote kadona'a hasabe'noni; hasaanelchi ha'note malee'e maalaqa ha'nokebaani. Oosete'e karra buk asiyyo hasisaaki oosetike hado malee oose hado ifike'e karra buk asitabaani. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Ha'no'a hiyye maalaqa ankanna umo anka midde sa'iseneexxi uwonoole gammadanoni. Yoona ani konne qico lummoshsha ha'no'o eeyyano wodda ha'no ane'e eetina'neek konne heenoqicinteeta? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Ani ha'no'ni ba'ote kadebo'noni; yaane kinni ani xaqarotinna sobiki ha'no'o abideenelcho ha'no'n labba'neen. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ha'noba'a erigeneke mitte manji gami'ni midde ha'no'o saameena'a? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Tito ha'noba'a dagaasha ani iso'o kadhateeneni; ookoonne dayyo no'okanna Titoni welti ergeeneni; eega Titota ha'no'o saameta? Aninna Titonna ha'no'a erigaantaaneeki mitte hafuurintemabaa? Me'a no'oxxinna mittetemabata?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Ha'no ta'aqico'ni hedina'neqici; ha'no edo umo no'oka ifi iimi'ni faachefantanesha assitinetee? No'o Kirsitoosi'ni he'ne haasonaanki Magen edoteni. Eeyaaneke anke jaaluwwa! No'o tenne duuchcha haasonaanelchi ha'no'o dayyesate hineeteni. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ani ha'noba'a dagano wodda; takitti ani hasaaneshsha ha'no hexxinebaangi, aninna ha'no hasina'nesha kadebo'nongi afeemanoke kandunu hiyye sodaataaneni. Iittanni ha'noxxe oddo'ni loli, gaabe, mufe, donnunte, diina, manjiinka summa balleesa, hame, umo ifika duka, cancensha hexxeexxe kadaani hiyye'e sodaataaneni. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Higgen ha'noba'a dagano wodda; Magen anki takitti ha'no edo ane'e salphisaani hiyye sodaataaneni; iittanni konnechchi edo insa'ne cubbo hunjeexxi muuxeexxe battitte yaane, yaababulna qil'misa aade aagebake heddi mannixxe'e yaado ane'ni geltaani hiyye'e sodaatanen.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Muuxatika Gorsanna Nage'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Yoonna ani ha'noba'a daga'naani tinni sakkaaxxeni; duuchhcinxi yaane kokeesendak lame yookaani sase dhugaaniten. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Langaxxa ha'noba dagen wodda xexxe'achchisati ha'noo'ni haaso'enan; ta'anna kinni bayya hedhenexxi konnechchini edi darre cubbo hujemakeari'a, welekanna xexxe'achisati haaso'anen; ta'a ha'noba'a illema hige dagano wodda; ayyi'ana mararabo'noni. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Konne toorini ani gami'ni haaso'aaneki Kiristoosite kadeexxa egendinaani; ha'nooba leeliteexxi Kirstoosixxe hunna malee'e; gonphe isixxebaani. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Isi fannote'ni fannsemeexxi reyechchi gonphaalsinsha kaddolna; ta'a Magenxe hunnaani hedhoti hedha'neeni; no'onna isinni welti ifi gonpheeneke kandeeneeni; no'onna ha'noni welti anfeeneke mittomini kinni isinni welti Magenxe hunnani he'naanoni.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Amanati hexxinnexxa kokeesate'e umo ha'noka qorqodhdhe; ifi hega uude; Yessuusi Kiristoosi ha'no giddo hedheexxa egendinebaata? Iitta kada gophphool hega uushote'ni iibinee hiyyoten. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />No'o hega uudemate'ni inbebe'noxxa ha'no egendinaaxxa adde asse'nanon. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ha'no hara elobaaxxa yaane assitinabaasha Magenba'a soodantanoni; soodantaanelchi fedhdheqico no'o wo'make kada gonpholenenna midde ha'no duuchchi wodda eloxxa yaane assitinaashate malee'e; wo'ma kandeenaxxa leelshatetebaan. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />No'o dhugaate'e hunjan malee'e dhugaate kadebaaxxa fedheexxa yaane hunjabo'noni. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />No'o ifi gonpheneke kandano wodda; ha'no kinni jabaatineeke kadinna wodda; gammandaaneni; soodachcho no'oxxi; ha'no wo'make kadinaashateni. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Tenne erga ha'nona'ni bayyate hedhenexxi borreesinenelchi tennexxeeteni; tenne buutonni ha'noba'a dagano wodda; Gootti ani'a uwwexxe dande'ani ha'no'o rakisabo'noni; Gootti dande'a an'a uwwechchi; ha'no'o ijaarate'e malee'e; ha'no diigateteban.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Yoona anke dayyuwwa nage'iki hedhdhe! Wo'ma manna kadde! Gorisa anka laqqe! Weli'ani weli aage! Nage'iki hedhdhe! Iitta kadinoole eeyyuntetikinna nage'inki Magen ha'noni welti hedhdhaani. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Qullumat weli sunqexina'ni weli nage'a aadhdhe! <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Amaanye duuchcha nage'a ha'no'aa dhaande'een.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Gootta Yessusi Kirsitoosiki badhaadhi; Magen eeyuntenna Woyyichchi Hafuurki mittoomi ha'no duuchchingeninni welti hedhowaali!<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>